            <name>
              <en>Master Qiao Li</en>
              <zh>乔丽</zh>
            </name>
            <bio>
              <en>A distinguished alumna of the elite Star Class at the National Academy of Chinese Theatre Arts, Master Qiao Li is a direct disciple of legendary Peking Opera virtuoso Guan Suoshuang and a Gold Award laureate at the inaugural National Peking Opera Grand Prix. Her celebrated international appearances include performing at the Academy Awards celebration for Crouching Tiger, Hidden Dragon and headlining Lincoln Center’s historic 80th-anniversary tribute commemorating Mei Lanfang’s tour of the United States.</en>
              <zh>乔丽毕业于中国戏曲学院明星班，是著名京剧表演艺术家关素霜的嫡传弟子，曾获全国首届京剧大奖赛金奖。她曾作为《卧虎藏龙》相关奥斯卡金像奖颁奖晚会的特邀演出嘉宾，并参加林肯中心纪念梅兰芳大师访美80周年的演出。</zh>
