            <name>
              <en>Anaiyah Sunshine (Ms. Florida America's United States)</en>
              <zh>阿奈雅·桑夏恩（美国联合州佛罗里达女士）</zh>
            </name>
            <bio>
              <en>Reigning Ms. Florida America’s United States 2026–2027, Anaiyah Sunshine is a dynamic vocalist, dancer, and international media entrepreneur. With over two decades in commercial entertainment and editorial fashion—including features in Essence and Vogue India—she commands the stage with cross-cultural artistry, performing fluently across genres and languages, notably Mandarin Chinese. As the founder of Miami Style Magazine, Anaiyah seamlessly bridges South Florida’s vibrant pulse with global creative expression.</en>
              <zh>现任 2026–2027 年度“美国联合州佛罗里达女士”，Anaiyah Sunshine 是一位集声乐、舞蹈与跨文化艺术于一身的杰出表演者与媒体创业家。她拥有二十余年跨国时尚与娱乐行业资历，曾登上《Essence》及《Vogue India》等国际刊物。Anaiyah 擅长运用包括中文普通话在内的多语种进行跨界演绎，并创立《Miami Style Magazine》，在舞台上生动融合南佛罗里达的热烈节拍与多元国际风尚。</zh>
            </bio>
          </performer>
        </performers>
